\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces (a) All $3{,}570$ removal steps and 65 anion rungs of the baseline archive, on a logarithmic ratio axis. The dashed line is the wall $3+2\sqrt  {2}$. (b) A linear zoom: the largest step inside the wall (nitrogen, $5.639665$), the largest anion rung inside (silver, $5.807902$), the wall, the smallest rung outside (silicon, $5.866539$) and the nearest step outside (caesium, $5.947101$). Every cutoff in the shaded band classifies all $3{,}570$ steps identically. Drawn by \texttt  {scripts/band\_\allowbreak  figure.py} from the shipped archive; no value is typed in.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:band}{{1}{5}{(a) All $3{,}570$ removal steps and 65 anion rungs of the baseline archive, on a logarithmic ratio axis. The dashed line is the wall $\W $. (b) A linear zoom: the largest step inside the wall (nitrogen, $5.639665$), the largest anion rung inside (silver, $5.807902$), the wall, the smallest rung outside (silicon, $5.866539$) and the nearest step outside (caesium, $5.947101$). Every cutoff in the shaded band classifies all $3{,}570$ steps identically. Drawn by \texttt {scripts/band\_figure.py} from the shipped archive; no value is typed in}{figure.1}{}}
